  "prefLabel": "He-C 6344.16 Billing Discrepancies",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 6344.16 Billing Discrepancies. Questions regarding billing discrepancies billed via NH Bridges shall be directed to the provider relations’ staff of the bureau of administrative operations in DCYF. All other questions shall be directed to either Medicaid or the private insurance company.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for He-C 6344) #9311, eff 11-5-08; ss by #12206, eff 6-10-17 (from He-C 6344.20)",
